o the distal portion of centrioles (PubMed:27185865). Also required for centriole-to-centrosome conversion during mitotic progression, but is dispensable for cartwheel removal or centriole disengagement (PubMed:25131205). Binds to and stabilizes centriolar microtubule (PubMed:27185865). May be involved in ciliogenesis (PubMed:38154379)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}